# Move a component that has a wire attached, so the move has to RECONNECT it.
# SelectTool.mouseReleased builds a MoveGesture and calls forceRequest(dx,dy); the
# Connector then routes replacement wire around the displaced port and hands back a
# ReplacementMap that SelectionActions.translate folds into the mutation. That search --
# AvoidanceMap, SearchNode, the priority queue -- is a whole ported subsystem whose only
# externally visible output is the set of wires this file ends up containing.
tool	add:AND Gate
click	300	200
tool	wiring
drag	400	200	300	200
tool	edit
drag	280	200	280	240
